{"+1 rep":"+1 opak.","10 tonne day":"Deň 10 ton","1M":"1M","1Y":"1R","3M":"3M","6M":"6M","A routine is a fixed set of exercises, like “Monday: legs”. Start it with one tap and Liftr fills in what you did last time.":"Plán je pevná sada cvikov, napr. „Pondelok: nohy“. Spustíš ho jedným ťuknutím a Liftr doplní hodnoty z minula.","A short workout today? Every rep counts.":"Dnes krátky tréning? Každé opakovanie sa počíta.","Add":"Pridať","Add all":"Pridať všetko","Add exercise":"Pridať cvik","Add pass":"Pridať kartu","Add set":"Pridať sériu","Add your gym pass":"Pridaj svoju permanentku","Adds this exercise with these sets":"Pridá tento cvik s týmito sériami","After":"Po","Afternoon workout":"Popoludňajší tréning","All":"Všetko","All data has been deleted.":"Všetky údaje boli odstránené.","Allow camera access in Settings, or choose a screenshot of your pass.":"Povoľ prístup k fotoaparátu v Nastaveniach alebo vyber snímku obrazovky permanentky.","Allow notifications for Liftr in Settings to get reminders.":"Povoľ hlásenia pre Liftr v Nastaveniach a budú ti chodiť pripomienky.","Also removed from Apple Health if Liftr saved it there.":"Odstráni sa aj z aplikácie Zdravie, ak ho tam Liftr uložil.","Analyse":"Analyzovať","Another gym":"Iná posilňovňa","Apple Health":"Zdravie","Apple Health is not available on this device.":"Aplikácia Zdravie nie je v tomto zariadení k dispozícii.","Archive":"Archivovať","Arms":"Ruky","Average":"Priemer","Avg. heart rate":"Priem. tep","Back":"Chrbát","Badges":"Odznaky","Badges {1}/{2}":"Odznaky {1}/{2}","Beat your best on an exercise":"Prekonaj svoj najlepší výkon v cvičení","Best volume":"Najlepší objem","Body":"Telo","Body fat":"Telesný tuk","Body fat (optional)":"Telesný tuk (voliteľné)","Bodyweight":"Vlastná váha","Cable":"Kladka","Camera and photos":"Kamera a fotky","Camera not available":"Fotoaparát nie je k dispozícii","Can't read file":"Súbor sa nedá prečítať","Cancel":"Zrušiť","Card colour":"Farba karty","Cardio":"Kardio","Charts are