,"Deletes all workouts, routines, body measurements, gym passes and your own exercises from this iPhone, and through iCloud from your iPad and Apple Watch too. Your settings stay.":"Odstráni všetky tréningy, plány, telesné merania, permanentky do posilňovne a tvoje vlastné cviky z tohto iPhonu a cez iCloud aj z iPadu a Apple Watch. Tvoje nastavenia zostanú.","Deleting an import removes only the workouts from that file. Workouts you logged in Liftr stay.":"Odstránenie importu odstráni iba tréningy z tohto súboru. Tréningy zaznamenané v Liftr zostanú.","Deleting your data":"Vymazanie tvojich údajov","Details":"Podrobnosti","Discard":"Zahodiť","Discard this workout?":"Zahodiť tento tréning?","Discard workout":"Zahodiť tréning","Do a set with {1} kg or more":"Urob sériu s {1} kg alebo viac","Do {1} reps in total":"Urob spolu {1} opakovaní","Done":"Hotovo","Download the import sheet":"Stiahnuť importnú tabuľku","Drop set":"Drop set","Duration":"Trvanie","E.g. seat position 4":"Napr. sedadlo 4","E.g. seat position, grip":"Napr. nastavenie sedadla, úchop","E.g. “Monday: legs” – start it with one tap.":"Napr. „Pondelok: nohy“ – spustíš ho jedným ťuknutím.","EARNED":"ZÍSKANÉ","Earlier import":"Predchádzajúci import","Early bird":"Ranné vtáča","Earned on {1}":"Získané {1}","Edit":"Upraviť","Edit exercise":"Upraviť cvik","Edit pass":"Upraviť permanentku","Edit routine":"Upraviť plán","Edit text":"Upraviť text","Est. 1-rep max":"Odh. 1RM","Est. max":"Odh. max","Estimated one-rep max":"Odhadované maximum na 1 opakovanie","Evening workout":"Večerný tréning","Every rep counts":"Každé opakovanie sa počíta","Excel or CSV":"Excel alebo CSV","Exercise":"Cvik","Exercises":"Cviky","Export to CSV":"Exportovať do CSV","Extra set":"Séria navyše","Favourite":"Obľúbený","Favourites":"Obľúbené","Finish":"Dokončiť","Finish a workout and your progress shows up here.":"Dokonči tréning a tvoj pokrok sa zobrazí tu.","Finish and save":"Dokončiť a uložiť","Finish this workout?":"Dokončiť tento tréning?","Finish your first workout":"Dokonči prvý tréning","Finish {1} workouts":"Dokonči tréningy: {1}","First record":"Prvý rekord","First time — set your starting point":"Prvýkrát — nastav si východiskový bod","First workout":"Prvý tréning","Five a week":"Päť do týždňa","Flips the badge":"Otočí odznak","Free up space in iCloud to keep syncing. Your workouts are safe on this device.":"Uvoľni miesto v iCloude, aby synchronizácia mohla pokračovať. Tvoje tréningy sú v tomto zariadení v bezpečí.","Free weight":"Voľná váha","Fresh start":"Nový začiatok","Full body":"Celé telo","Glutes":"Zadok","Gym":"Posilňovňa","Gym pass":"Permanentka","Heaviest":"Najťažšie","Heaviest set per workout":"Najťažšia séria v tréningu","History":"História","Import":"Importovať","Import from":"Importovať z","Imported":"Importované","Imported workout":"Importovaný tréning","Imported workouts go into your history and charts, but are not written to Apple Health.":"Importované tréningy sa zobrazia v histórii a grafoch, ale nezapisujú sa do aplikácie Zdravie.","Imported {1}":"Importované {1}","Imports":"Importy","In this workout":"V tomto tréningu","KM":"KM","Keep going":"Cvičiť ďalej","Keep your {1}-week streak going.":"Trénuješ {1} týž. po sebe – len tak ďalej!","Kilograms (kg)":"Kilogramy (kg)","LAST":"MINULÉ","LAST WORKOUT":"POSLEDNÝ TRÉNING","Last synced {1}":"Posledná synchronizácia: {1}","Last time":"Minule","Last time: {1}. Tap to use":"Naposledy: {1}. Klepnutím použiješ","Last updated: November 2026":"Posledná aktualizácia: november 2026","Last workout":"Posledný tréning","Lean body mass":"Beztuková hmota","Legs":"Nohy","Library":"Knižnica","Lift 10 tonnes in one workout":"Zdvihni 10 ton v jednom tréningu","Lift {1} tonnes in total":"Zdvihni celkom {1} t","Lifted":"Zdvihnuté","Lifted in total":"Zdvihnuté celkom","Lifted this week":"Zdvihnuté tento týždeň","Liftr contains no analytics, no third-party code and no tracking of any kind.":"Liftr neobsahuje analytiku, kód tretích strán ani žiadnu formu sledovania.","Liftr couldn't find a QR code or barcode in this picture.":"Liftr na tomto obrázku nenašiel QR kód ani čiarový kód.","Liftr couldn't find a date column with exercises in this file.":"Liftr v tomto súbore nenašiel stĺpec s dátumom a cvikmi.","Liftr couldn't find any exercises. Use lines like “Leg press 3x12 40 kg”.":"Liftr nenašiel žiadne cviky. Použi riadky ako „Leg press 3x12 40 kg“.","Liftr export":"Export z Liftru","Liftr has no account, no server and no advertising. Your workouts, exercises, routines, body measurements and gym pass are stored on your device and in your own private iCloud.":"Liftr nemá účet, server ani reklamy. Tvoje tréningy, cviky, plány, telesné miery a permanentka sú uložené v tvojom zariadení a v tvojom vlastnom súkromnom iCloude.","Liftr is built to keep your training private.":"Liftr je vytvorený tak, aby tvoje tréningy zostali súkromné.","Liftr saves workouts with duration and calories and reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate. Change access in the Health app → Profile → Apps → Liftr.":"Liftr ukladá tréningy s dĺžkou a kalóriami a číta tvoju hmotnosť, zloženie tela a pokojový tep. Prístup zmeníš v aplikácii Zdravie → Profil → Aplikácie → Liftr.","Liftr shows what you did last time, your records and how much stronger you're getting.":"Liftr ukazuje tvoj minulý tréning, rekordy a o koľko silnieš.","Liftr tries again automatically.":"Liftr to automaticky skúsi znova.","Liftr tries again later. Your workouts are safe on this device.":"Liftr to skúsi znova neskôr. Tvoje tréningy sú v tomto zariadení v bezpečí.","Liftr uses it to greet you and puts it on the back of the badges you earn. You can change it later in Settings.":"Liftr ho používa na pozdrav a dáva ho na zadnú stranu odznakov, ktoré získaš. Neskôr ho môžeš zmeniť v Nastaveniach.","Linked to {1}":"Prepojené s {1}","Log weight":"Zapísať hmotnosť","Log your exercises, sets, reps and weight in seconds — no more notes.":"Zapisuj cviky, série, opakovania a váhu za pár sekúnd — žiadne ďalšie poznámky.","MIN":"MIN","Machine":"Stroj","Make a routine":"Vytvor plán","Manage data":"Správa údajov","Marathon session":"Maratónsky tréning","Mark set done":"Označiť sériu ako hotovú","Max":"Max","Min":"Min","Minimise":"Minimalizovať","Moments":"Chvíle","Morning workout":"Ranný tréning","Most reps":"Najviac opak.","Muscle group":"Svalová partia","My passes":"Moje karty","My routines":"Moje plány","Name":"Názov","Name of the gym":"Názov posilňovne","Name on the pass (optional)":"Meno na permanentke (voliteľné)","Name, e.g. Monday: legs":"Názov, napr. Pondelok: nohy","New":"Nový","New badges":"Nové odznaky","New exercise":"Nový cvik","New records":"Nové rekordy","New routine":"Nový plán","Next":"Ďalej","Next exercise":"Ďalší cvik","Night owl":"Nočná sova","No code found":"Nenašiel sa žiadny kód","No data in this period.":"V tomto období nie sú žiadne údaje.","No data yet":"Zatiaľ žiadne dáta","No imports yet.":"Zatiaľ žiadne importy.","No routines yet":"Zatiaľ žiadne plány","No tracking":"Žiadne sledovanie","No weight yet. Log it here or connect a smart scale to Apple Health.":"Zatiaľ žiadna hmotnosť. Zapíš ju tu alebo prepoj inteligentnú váhu s aplikáciou Zdravie.","No workout on this day.":"V tento deň žiadny tréning.","No workouts this week yet — next week is a fresh start.":"Tento týždeň zatiaľ bez tréningu — budúci týždeň je nový začiatok.","No workouts yet":"Zatiaľ žiadne tréningy","Not connected":"Neprepojené","Not done yet.":"Zatiaľ nevykonané.","Not earned yet":"Ešte nezískané","Not now":"Teraz nie","Note":"Poznámka","Note (optional)":"Poznámka (voliteľné)","Notes":"Poznámky","Notifications":"Hlásenia","Notifications are off":"Hlásenia sú vypnuté","Now":"Teraz","One row per training day with a date column and a column per exercise, e.g. “Date | Leg press | Chest press” with “45”, “27 (3×10)” or “25 / 18” in the cells. A file with one row per set (date, exercise, reps, weight) works too, as does a Liftr export.":"Jeden riadok na tréningový deň so stĺpcom dátumu a jedným stĺpcom na cvik, napr. “Dátum | Leg press | Chest press” s hodnotami “45”, “27 (3×10)” alebo “25 / 18” v bunkách. Funguje aj súbor s jedným riadkom na sériu (dátum, cvik, opakovania, váha), rovnako ako export z Liftr.","Only with your permission, Liftr reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate, and saves workouts, calories, distance and weight. Health data never leaves your devices through Liftr and is never used for advertising. You can change access at any time in the Health app.":"Iba s tvojím povolením Liftr číta tvoju hmotnosť, zloženie tela a pokojovú tepovú frekvenciu a ukladá tréningy, kalórie, vzdialenosť a hmotnosť. Zdravotné údaje cez Liftr nikdy neopustia tvoje zariadenia a nikdy sa nepoužívajú na reklamu. Prístup môžeš kedykoľvek zmeniť v apke Zdravie.","Open Settings":"Otvoriť Nastavenia","Other file":"Iný súbor","Paste":"Vložiť","Pause":"Pauza","Point the camera at the code on your pass":"Namier fotoaparát na kód na permanentke","Pounds (lb)":"Libry (lb)","Previous workouts":"Predchádzajúce tréningy","Privacy":"Súkromie","Profile":"Profil","Progress":"Pokrok","Questions?":"Otázky?","REPS":"OPAK.","REST":"PAUZA","Ready to train, {1}?":"Pripravený trénovať, {1}?","Ready to train?":"Ideme trénovať?","Records":"Rekordy","Reminders":"Pripomienky","Reminders and the rest timer are planned on your device. There is no push server.":"Pripomienky a odpočet pauzy sa plánujú v tvojom zariadení. Neexistuje žiadny push server.","Reminders are planned on this device. A day you already trained (also on Apple Watch or iPad) is skipped.":"Pripomienky sa plánujú v tomto zariadení. Deň, keď už máš odcvičené (aj na Apple Watch alebo iPade), sa preskočí.","Remove exercise":"Odstrániť cvik","Remove favourite":"Odstrániť z obľúbených","Rename a column to link it to an exercise you already have.":"Premenuj stĺpec, aby sa prepojil s cvikom, ktorý už máš.","Reps per set":"Opakovaní v sérii","Rest":"Pauza",